This project includes material from the following third-party projects.

================================================================================
1. SCOWL (Spell Checker Oriented Word Lists), version 2020.12.07
   http://wordlist.aspell.net/
================================================================================

Used in:
  - Wordle/app/Wordle/data/answers.txt
  - Wordle/app/Wordle/data/allowed_guesses.txt
  - Wordle/app/Wordle/data/word_entropy.json (computed from the two lists)
  - training-data.jsonl, validation-data.jsonl (answers drawn from answers.txt)

These files are output of build_word_lists.py, which selects five-letter words
from the SCOWL english-words and american-words lists (size 35 and below for
answers, size 80 and below for guesses) and filters them. SCOWL's size-80 list
includes the UK Advanced Cryptics Dictionary (UKACD).

